# The Icons view: `v` changes the view.
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/icone.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo main ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Type "v"
Sleep 600ms
Down
Right 6
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/icone.png"
